OL,5,G2100 I Luv U Jimmy Spud
OL,6,     FSchoolboy Jimmy Spud is
OL,7,     FNewcastle's only trainee angel.
OL,8,     FCan he use his powers to save
OL,9,     Fsomeone he loves? Stars Gareth
OL,10,     FBrown.
OL,11,G2200 Omid Djalili: Namaste
OL,12,     F2/4. Omid tackles Iran, conflict
OL,13,     Fand identity, asking how we
OL,14,     Fnavigate an increasingly divided
OL,15,     Fworld without losing sight of the
OL,16,     Fpeople caught in the middle.
OL,17,G2230 Lemn Sissay's Origin Stories
OL,18,     F2/4. Poet Lemn Sissay's comic and
OL,19,     Fpoetic look at the treatment of
OL,20,     Fchildren raised in care, based on
OL,21,     Fhis own experiences. From 2016.
